    "title": "New Yorkers hold makeshift funeral for Metrocard as OMNY takes over - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Cheyenne Ubiera ,\n16 hours ago For over 30 years, the MetroCard was a staple for many New Yorkers; however, the yellow cards are now being laid to rest. New Yorkers held a makeshift funeral for the MetroCard after the MTA announced that it would no longer sell or distribute them after Dec. 31, 2025. The OMNY card, introduced in 2017, will fully replace it. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
